flowchart TD
  %% Source: crates/shipyard-engine/src/tick.rs, Engine::tick.
  Start(["Timer fires or the person clicks Sync<br/>interval 60 s, minimum 30 s, jitter up to 20%"])
  Start --> T{"Issue tracker due<br/>or forced?"}
  T -->|yes| PT["1. Poll the issue tracker<br/>items updated since the last good poll minus 120 s<br/>compare, update the mirror"]
  T -->|no| F
  PT -->|"poll fails"| BO["Keep the mirror<br/>count a failure, back off: interval x 2, 5 min at most"]
  PT --> F{"Code host linked<br/>and due or forced?"}
  BO --> F
  F -->|yes| PF["2. Poll the code host<br/>pull requests; the first read is a baseline"]
  F -->|no| D
  PF --> D["3. Hand off<br/>new comments become answers or events for the factory"]
  D --> S["4. Stop runs<br/>ticket is terminal, except a run whose pull request merged<br/>a run with a pull request waits when the code host poll failed"]
  S --> RS["4b. Resume and release<br/>a run paused by the day budget resumes on the next day<br/>a run of a project that is not open releases its claim after 10 min<br/>a ticket reply by a team member unblocks an escalated run"]
  RS --> P{"Issue tracker poll<br/>failed?"}
  P -->|yes| H
  P -->|no| PU["5. Pick up<br/>filter, concurrency, kill switch<br/>no restart: skip a ticket whose last run ended, until the ticket changes or a person clicks Run<br/>at Done the pickup label goes<br/>read the ticket again, then claim"]
  PU --> C{"Claim"}
  C -->|"won"| R["Start the run<br/>remember the comments it already has"]
  C -->|"held"| H
  C -->|"lost: a live stamp of another machine"| H
  R --> H["6. Heartbeat<br/>refresh stamps, drop claims no run holds<br/>stop a run whose claim another machine took"]
  H --> E(["Send the Tick event"])
  E --> N(["The window reads the checks of the pull requests of the person<br/>one notice for each new head and result<br/>the first good read of a project makes no notice"])

  %% The file watcher is separate from the tick (crates/shipyard-app/src/watch.rs, Watcher::step).
  W0(["The system reports the changes of the active project (the notify crate)<br/>a switch or a close starts a new watch with no event"])
  W0 --> W1["Drop the paths of .git, node_modules, target and the .gitignore of the root"]
  W1 --> W2{"Quiet for 300 ms after a change,<br/>or 2 s since the first change?"}
  W2 -->|no| W0
  W2 -->|yes| W3(["Send one files-changed event with the paths<br/>and a truncated flag when more than 500 paths changed or the system lost events"])
  W3 --> W4(["The window reads again the design, specs, knowledge, refs and Code queries that the paths feed, or every query when truncated<br/>an editor with unsaved text keeps it, and the stamp conflict shows at the save"])
